IMPORT prelude

-- Choice of Law (Limitation Periods) Act 1993 (Victoria) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- Built-in date functions only (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL, DATE_DAY, DATE_MONTH, DATE_YEAR), not
-- the daydate library. The Act's one fixed day is its commencement, 23 November 1993 (s 2 and the endnotes: assented to
-- and in operation on 23 November 1993). The other dates are those of the limitation law of the place whose law
-- governs the claim (s 5), which this Act does not fix: a period of years and months, asked as a fact, is counted here
-- to a last day (forks F5, F6 in NOTES.md).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Choice of Law
-- (Limitation Periods) Act 1993, Act No. 100/1993, Version No. 003 (16 August 2012), not the authorised version.
